senses.gloss:
1. लुट् (cf. √ रुत् and 1. लुठ्) cl. 1. Ā. लोटते, to resist;
to suffer pain;
to shine, Dhātup. xviii, 8;
 cl. 10. P. लोटयति, to speak;
to shine, xxxiii, 81.

2. लुट् (connected with √ 2. लुठ्) cl. 1. 4. P. लोटति, लुट्यति (only p. लुट्यत्, rolling, in Bhaṭṭ.; Gr. also pf. लुलोट &c.),
to roll, roll about, wallow, Dhātup. ix, 27;
 xxvi, 113;
 cl. 1. Ā. लोटते, to go, Naigh. ii, 14:
Caus. or cl. 10. P. लोटयति See under √ 1. लुट्.
